      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 44,
      "str": "Variations of Zero Trust Architecture Approaches",
      "x": 100.8,
      "y": 461.04,
      "width": 258.5,
      "height": 10.98,
      "right": 359.3,
      "visualLineId": 17,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 45,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 435.48,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 46,
      "str": "There are several ways that an enterprise can enact a ZTA for workflows. These approaches vary",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 435.48,
      "width": 465.78,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 537.78,
      "visualLineId": 18,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 47,
      "str": "in the components used and in the main source of policy rules for an organization. Each",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 421.68,
      "width": 421.14,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 493.14,
      "visualLineId": 19,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 48,
      "str": "approach implements all the tenets of ZT (see Section",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 407.88,
      "width": 258.6,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 330.6,
      "visualLineId": 20,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 49,
      "str": " ",
      "x": 330.6,
      "y": 407.88,
      "width": 0.25,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 330.85,
      "visualLineId": 20,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 50,
      "str": "2.1",
      "x": 333.6,
      "y": 407.88,
      "width": 15,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 348.6,
      "visualLineId": 20,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 51,
      "str": ") but may use one or two (or one",
      "x": 348.6,
      "y": 407.88,
      "width": 156.59,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 505.18,
      "visualLineId": 20,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 52,
      "str": "component) as the main driver of policies. A full ZT solution will include elements of all three",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 394.08,
      "width": 454.31,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 526.31,
      "visualLineId": 21,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 53,
      "str": "approaches. The approaches include enhanced identity governance–driven, logical micro-",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 380.28,
      "width": 430.48,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 502.48,
      "visualLineId": 22,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 54,
      "str": "segmentation, and network-based segmentation.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 366.48,
      "width": 231,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 303,
      "visualLineId": 23,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 55,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 340.68,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 56,
      "str": "Certain approaches lend themselves to some use cases more than others. An organization looking",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 340.68,
      "width": 467.22,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 539.22,
      "visualLineId": 24,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 57,
      "str": "to develop a ZTA for its enterprise may find that its chosen use case and existing policies point",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 326.88,
      "width": 456.16,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 528.16,
      "visualLineId": 25,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 58,
      "str": "to one approach over others. That does not mean the other approaches would not work but rather",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 313.08,
      "width": 464.2,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 536.2,
      "visualLineId": 26,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 59,
      "str": "that other approaches may be more difficult to implement and may require more fundamental",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 299.28,
      "width": 448.18,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 520.18,
      "visualLineId": 27,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 60,
      "str": "changes to how the enterprise currently conducts business flows.",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 285.48,
      "width": 310.86,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 382.86,
      "visualLineId": 28,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 61,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 260.58,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 62,
      "str": "3.1.1",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 260.58,
      "width": 24.46,
      "height": 10.98,
      "right": 96.46,
      "visualLineId": 29,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 63,
      "str": " ",
      "x": 96.46,
      "y": 260.58,
      "width": 1.05,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 97.51,
      "visualLineId": 29,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 64,
      "str": "ZTA Using Enhanced Identity Governance",
      "x": 108,
      "y": 260.58,
      "width": 219.32,
      "height": 10.98,
      "right": 327.32,
      "visualLineId": 29,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 65,
      "str": "",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 235.02,
      "width": 0,
      "height": 0,
      "right": 76,
      "visualLineId": null,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 66,
      "str": "The enhanced identity governance approach to developing a ZTA uses the identity of actors as",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 235.02,
      "width": 453.77,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 525.77,
      "visualLineId": 30,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 67,
      "str": "the key component of policy creation. If it were not for subjects requesting access to enterprise",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 221.22,
      "width": 455.2,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 527.2,
      "visualLineId": 31,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 68,
      "str": "resources, there would be no need to create access polices. For this approach, enterprise resource",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 207.42,
      "width": 464.87,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 536.87,
      "visualLineId": 32,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 69,
      "str": "access policies are based on identity and assigned attributes. The primary requirement for",
      "x": 72,
      "y": 193.62,
      "width": 429.45,
      "height": 12,
      "right": 501.45,
      "visualLineId": 33,
      "inferredColumn": null
    },
    {
      "itemIndex": 70,
      "str": "resource access is based on the access privileges granted to the given subject. Other factors such",
      "x": 72,
